    "name": "Travel Size Lotion Stick w/ Lemongrass & Orange Essential Oils & Turmeric",
    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">A little bit goes a long way! Highly moisturizing, our lotion stick sinks deeply into your thirsty skin. For normal to dry, sensitive or problem skin.&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Made from just a few good, nourishing &amp; all edible ingredients:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Shea Butter - moisturizes without clogging pores, rich in vitamins A &amp; E, gentle on sensitive skin, soothes burns, helps fight acne, eczema, psoriasis, dermatitis &amp; wrinkles!</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Coconut &amp; Palm oils - has antibacterial properties helping heal damaged skin</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Bee’s wax - offers anti-inflammatory, antibacterial and antiviral benefits</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Vitamin E oil - treats scars, sunburn, acne &amp; wrinkles</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Lemongrass&nbsp;&amp; Orange Essential Oils&nbsp;- offer a lovely &amp; simple fragrance as well as healing properties.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">I really recommend this moisturizer also for older people&nbsp;who have thin, dry, damaged &amp; cracked skin. So soothing and moisturizing for face, hands, &amp; dry feet, and everywhere else!</span><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Made in our home in Oregon - you can’t get any better than that!</span></p>",
